<article xml:lang="en">
  <front>
    <title>Observing Tidal Wetlands</title>
    <authors><author>R. Chen</author><author>M. Ibarra</author></authors>
    <abstract>We compare <em>in situ</em> measurements with <ref target="r1">prior surveys</ref>.</abstract>
  </front>
  <body>
    <section id="method">
      <heading>Methods</heading>
      <para>Samples were collected at dawn.<br/>Coordinates were recorded independently.</para>
      <list ordered="yes">
        <item>Calibrate the instrument.</item>
        <item>Record salinity and temperature.</item>
      </list>
      <figure>
        <caption>Sampling locations</caption>
        <image src="map-01.svg" alt="Map of three sites"/>
      </figure>
    </section>
    <section id="results">
      <heading>Results</heading>
      <para>The northern site showed a <strong>modest</strong> increase.</para>
      <para><quote>Patterns were consistent across two seasons.</quote></para>
    </section>
  </body>
  <back>
    <references><entry id="r1">Field Survey Archive, 2024.</entry></references>
